#: codec/1/263/0x107150/79
msgid ""
"And I lost the light of my life.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/263/0x107150/80
msgid ""
"I now find myself victim to an incredibly irrational\n"
"emotion of my own.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/263/0x107150/81
msgid ""
"That someone, the one she wanted to confess her\n"
"sin to...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/263/0x107150/82
msgid ""
"Could it be the one who took her life?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/263/0x107150/83
msgid ""
"The very thought drives me utterly mad with\n"
"jealousy.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/263/0x107150/84
msgid ""
"One day, I will discover the truth.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/0
msgid ""
"Enter simulation date.\n"
msgstr ""
"输入模拟日期。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/1
msgid ""
"August 24.\n"
msgstr ""
"8月24日。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/2
msgid ""
"Location?\n"
msgstr ""
"地点？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/3
msgid ""
"Tselinoyarsk, USSR.\n"
msgstr ""
"苏联，采利诺亚尔斯克。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/4
msgid ""
"Mission?\n"
msgstr ""
"任务？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/5
msgid ""
"Support a covert agent whose objective is the\n"
"rescue of a nuclear weapons scientist.\n"
msgstr ""
"支援一名秘密特工，其目标是\n"
"营救一名核武器科学家。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/6
msgid ""
"Who is the agent?\n"
msgstr ""
"特工是谁？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/7
msgid ""
"Your student. Your... most beloved...\n"
msgstr ""
"你学生。你最爱的……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/8
msgid ""
"...Acknowledged. Define current mission progress.\n"
msgstr ""
"……明白。说明当前任务进展。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/9
msgid ""
"With your help, the agent has successfully made\n"
"contact with the target.\n"
msgstr ""
"在你的帮助下，特工成功\n"
"与目标取得了联系。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/10
msgid ""
"All that's left is to wait for recovery.\n"
msgstr ""
"剩下的就是等待接应。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/11
msgid ""
"Now, deduce the best course of action.\n"
msgstr ""
"现在，推断最佳行动方案。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/12
msgid ""
"...I take the scientist away from the agent.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我从特工手中带走科学家。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/14
msgid ""
"As a gift when I defect.\n"
msgstr ""
"叛逃献礼。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/15
msgid ""
"...Why are you defecting?\n"
msgstr ""
"……你为何叛逃？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/16
msgid ""
"To reform my Special Forces unit with my former\n"
"comrades-in-arms.\n"
msgstr ""
"重组我的特种部队，与我的前战友们\n"
"并肩作战。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/17
msgid ""
"NO! I don't want to know your objective. I'm asking\n"
"for the reason.\n"
msgstr ""
"不！我不想知道你的目标。我问的是\n"
"原因。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/18
msgid ""
"Why are you betraying your country?\n"
msgstr ""
"你为何背叛你的国家？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/19
msgid ""
"...I do not defect in order to betray America.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我叛逃并非为背叛美国。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/20
msgid ""
"Betrayal is merely the outcome of that defection.\n"
msgstr ""
"背叛只是叛逃的结果。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/21
msgid ""
"Response time is always slower here...\n"
msgstr ""
"这里响应总是更慢……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/22
msgid ""
"Perhaps she lacks confidence in her judgment.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许她对自己的判断缺乏信心。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/23
msgid ""
"You're a hero in the West. Why should the Soviets\n"
"trust you?\n"
msgstr ""
"你在西方是个英雄。苏联人凭什么\n"
"信任你？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/24
msgid ""
"In addition to the scientist,\n"
msgstr ""
"除科学家外，\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/25
msgid ""
"I provide them with a portable nuclear warhead\n"
msgstr ""
"我还提供一枚便携核弹头\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/26
msgid ""
"in order to win the favor of a Russian GRU officer.\n"
msgstr ""
"以博取一名苏联GRU军官的欢心。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/27
msgid ""
"...And then you launched it.\n"
msgstr ""
"……然后你发射了。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/28
msgid ""
"Launched... the nuke? Me?\n"
msgstr ""
"发射……核弹？我？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/29
msgid ""
"That's right. At a target inside Soviet territory.\n"
msgstr ""
"没错。目标是苏联境内。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/30
msgid ""
"Nuclear weapons... make my blood run cold. They\n"
"blot out the future. How... could I...?\n"
msgstr ""
"核武器……让我胆寒。它们\n"
"抹杀未来。我……怎能……？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/31
msgid ""
"Karma... Is... is it my karma?\n"
msgstr ""
"业……这……这是我的业吗？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/32
msgid ""
"The karma my mistake has brought upon us... My...\n"
"My...\n"
msgstr ""
"我错给我们的业……我的……\n"
"我的……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/33
msgid ""
"Attention. Discontinue forward reasoning.\n"
"Cross-check with knowledge base.\n"
msgstr ""
"注意。停止向前推理。\n"
"与知识库交叉核对。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/34
#: codec/1/265/0x109080/40
msgid ""
"Affirmative.\n"
msgstr ""
"确认。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/35
msgid ""
"...Cross-check complete. Revising conclusion as\n"
"follows:\n"
msgstr ""
"……交叉核对完成。修正结论\n"
"如下：\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/36
msgid ""
"I steal the new weapons developed by the scientist\n"
msgstr ""
"我偷走科学家研发的新武器\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/37
msgid ""
"and then launch the nuke at the weapons design\n"
"bureau.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后向武器设计局发射核弹。\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/38
msgid ""
"Forward and backward reasoning are in conflict...\n"
msgstr ""
"正向与反向推理冲突……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/39
msgid ""
"Attention. Return to forward reasoning.\n"
msgstr ""
"注意。回到正向推理。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/41
msgid ""
"...Your apprentice returns for the scientist.\n"
msgstr ""
"……你的徒弟回来找科学家了。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/42
msgid ""
"I send him away.\n"
msgstr ""
"我赶走他。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/43
msgid ""
"He doesn't give up.\n"
msgstr ""
"他不肯放弃。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/44
msgid ""
"I send my comrades to defeat him.\n"
msgstr ""
"我派同伴去击败他。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/45
msgid ""
"All of them fail.\n"
msgstr ""
"全失败了。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/46
msgid ""
"Even the GRU officer who oversaw your defection\n"
"is defeated by your apprentice\n"
msgstr ""
"连监督你叛逃的格鲁乌军官\n"
"也被你的徒弟击败\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/47
msgid ""
"- along with the new weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"连同新武器。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/48
msgid ""
"Now, what is your course of action?\n"
msgstr ""
"那么，你会怎么做？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/49
msgid ""
"...I fight him.\n"
msgstr ""
"……我跟他打。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/50
msgid ""
"Why? With your GRU patron dead, there's no\n"
"reason for you to fight.\n"
msgstr ""
"为啥？格鲁乌靠山已死，\n"
"你没理由再打。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/51
msgid ""
"Why not just run away?\n"
msgstr ""
"何不一走了之？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/52
msgid ""
"I... must fight him.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……必须跟他打。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/53
msgid ""
"I do not see the reason. With a solider of your\n"
"caliber on his side,\n"
msgstr ""
"我想不通。以你这种身手的士兵\n"
"在他那边，\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/54
msgid ""
"how could the GRU officer be defeated to begin\n"
"with? Did you betray him, too?\n"
msgstr ""
"格鲁乌军官怎么可能被击败？\n"
"你也背叛了他？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/55
msgid ""
"I... I've been waiting... for a long time.\n"
msgstr ""
"我……我已经等了……很久。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/56
msgid ""
"You could switch allegiance from GRU to KGB,\n"
msgstr ""
"你可以从格鲁乌转投克格勃，\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/57
msgid ""
"and take the remaining nuke as a gift.\n"
msgstr ""
"把剩下的核弹当见面礼。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/58
msgid ""
"There's no chance they wouldn't welcome a hero\n"
"of your stature.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们绝不会拒绝你这种\n"
"级别的英雄。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/59
msgid ""
"Drift away. My place is with them now.\n"
msgstr ""
"走吧。我归宿跟他们一起。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/60
msgid ""
"I didn't ask you that! Give me the basis for your\n"
"reasoning! Tell me the truth...\n"
msgstr ""
"我没问这个！给我你推理的依据！\n"
"说实话……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/61
msgid ""
"Politics determine who you face on the battlefield.\n"
msgstr ""
"政治决定你在战场上面对谁。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/62
msgid ""
"Why won't you answer me?! It's like you were just\n"
"waiting for him to kill you!\n"
msgstr ""
"你为什么不回答我？！\n"
"简直像在等他杀你！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/63
msgid ""
"I was disloyal... Betrayed my country... I deserve to\n"
"die...\n"
msgstr ""
"我不忠……背叛了我的国家……我该死……\n"
"\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/64
msgid ""
"How can you say that?! You can't be a traitor!\n"
"You're not that kind of person!\n"
msgstr ""
"你怎么能这么说？！你不可能是叛徒！\n"
"你不是那种人！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/65
msgid ""
"Kill me... Kill me now...\n"
msgstr ""
"杀了我……现在就杀了我……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/66
msgid ""
"STOP IT! STOP IT! Attention! Discontinue reasoning!!\n"
msgstr ""
"住手！住手！注意！停止推理！！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/67
msgid ""
"One must die, and one must live...\n"
msgstr ""
"一人得死，一人得活……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/68
msgid ""
"Stop it, damn you! DISCONTINUE!\n"
msgstr ""
"住手，该死的！停止！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/69
msgid ""
"Life's end... Isn't it beautiful...?\n"
msgstr ""
"生命的终结……不美吗……？\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/70
msgid ""
"SHUT DOWN!!\n"
msgstr ""
"关机！\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/71
msgid ""
"...Always in the same place, her reasoning goes\n"
"haywire.\n"
msgstr ""
"……总在同一处，她推理就\n"
"出错。\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/72
msgid ""
"Someone holds the key... Perhaps it's him...\n"
msgstr ""
"有人握着钥匙……也许是他……\n"

#: codec/1/265/0x109080/73
msgid ""
"I'll get it out of him. One way or another...!\n"
msgstr ""
"我会撬开他嘴。不管怎样……！\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/0
msgid ""
"As of today I will be living here at Mother Base.\n"
"Now my real trial begins.\n"
msgstr ""
"从今天起我就住在母基地了。\n"
"现在真正的考验开始了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/1
msgid ""
"Zadornov was paying my room, board, and tuition,\n"
msgstr ""
"扎多尔诺夫付我的食宿和学费，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/2
msgid ""
"but he has since been captured.\n"
msgstr ""
"但他后来被抓了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/3
msgid ""
"I told the man that with no more money from the\n"
"KGB,\n"
msgstr ""
"我告诉那人，KGB\n"
"不再给钱了，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/4
msgid ""
"I could no longer afford school.\n"
msgstr ""
"我再也上不起学了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/5
msgid ""
"...He bought my story, and when I said I would be\n"
"willing to work,\n"
msgstr ""
"……他相信了我的说辞，当我说我\n"
"愿意工作时，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/6
msgid ""
"he took pity on me and let me stay.\n"
msgstr ""
"他可怜我，让我留下。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/7
msgid ""
"For some reason Miller really plead my case.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知为何米勒真替我求了情。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/8
msgid ""
"That was helpful, but the man is still a fool.\n"
msgstr ""
"那有用，但这人还是个蠢货。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/9
msgid ""
"His men are no better.\n"
msgstr ""
"他手下也一样。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/10
msgid ""
"They think their training makes them strong,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们以为训练让他们变强，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/11
msgid ""
"but that kind of strength is nothing in the face of\n"
"true power.\n"
msgstr ""
"但那种力量在\n"
"真正的力量面前不值一提。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/12
msgid ""
"And better yet, they wait on me hand and foot,\n"
msgstr ""
"更妙的是，他们对我百般伺候，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/13
msgid ""
"believing I am just a schoolgirl.\n"
msgstr ""
"以为我只是个女学生。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/14
msgid ""
"Looks like I won't be working too hard, after all.\n"
msgstr ""
"看来我不用太辛苦。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/15
msgid ""
"Just today,\n"
msgstr ""
"今天，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/16
msgid ""
"while scouting out the living quarters,\n"
msgstr ""
"我侦察生活区时，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/17
msgid ""
"I saw a group of them in the corner of the deck\n"
"making a fuss.\n"
msgstr ""
"看到甲板角落有一群人\n"
"在闹腾。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/18
msgid ""
"Going over for a look, I saw they were feeding a\n"
"kitten.\n"
msgstr ""
"我过去一看，他们在喂\n"
"一只小猫。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/19
msgid ""
"A bunch of grown, hard men, and they are the\n"
"ones acting like schoolgirls!\n"
msgstr ""
"一群粗壮的硬汉，\n"
"却像女学生一样！\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/20
msgid ""
"\"Look, isn't he cute?\" What is wrong with them?\n"
msgstr ""
"“看，它多可爱？”他们有病吧？\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/21
msgid ""
"Disgusted, I just nodded and smiled.\n"
msgstr ""
"我嫌恶地点点头笑笑。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/22
msgid ""
"I must stay in character, after all.\n"
msgstr ""
"毕竟我得演好角色。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/23
msgid ""
"I indulged their chit-chat for a few moments,\n"
msgstr ""
"我陪他们闲聊了几句，\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/24
msgid ""
"then one of them asked me to give the thing a\n"
"name.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后有人让我给那东西\n"
"起个名。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/25
msgid ""
"They had just taken it from its mother.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们刚把它从母猫身边拿走。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/26
msgid ""
"I named it Nuke.\n"
msgstr ""
"我给它起名核弹。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/27
msgid ""
"I improvised some nonsense about how\n"
msgstr ""
"我随口编了句胡话，说\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/28
msgid ""
"\"our compassion for living things can help prevent\n"
"wars.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“对生命的怜悯能防止\n"
"战争。”\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/29
msgid ""
"The men gave me a little fish.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们给我条小鱼。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/30
msgid ""
"I held it out in my palm, and the kitten happily ate\n"
"it up.\n"
msgstr ""
"我摊在手心，小猫高兴地\n"
"吃了。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/31
msgid ""
"What a pathetic... feeble creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"多可悲……软弱生物。\n"

#: codec/1/266/0x10a6e0/32
msgid ""
"It sickens me.\n"
msgstr ""
"真恶心。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/0
msgid ""
"Today Chico invited me to go fishing with the\n"
"soldiers.\n"
msgstr ""
"今天奇科邀我和士兵们\n"
"去钓鱼。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/1
msgid ""
"I suppose finding one's own food does have its\n"
"merit,\n"
msgstr ""
"自己找食物或许有\n"
"好处，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/2
msgid ""
"but I prefer not to be involved in such a degrading\n"
"task.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我不想干这种\n"
"丢人的事。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/3
msgid ""
"And their prattling on about fishing being \"fun\" is\n"
"nonsense.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们唠叨钓鱼多“好玩”，\n"
"纯属胡扯。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/4
msgid ""
"I'm not here to find playmates.\n"
msgstr ""
"我不是来找玩伴的。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/5
msgid ""
"Nevertheless, distasteful as it was,\n"
msgstr ""
"尽管如此，虽然恶心，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/6
msgid ""
"I went along in order to maintain my cover.\n"
msgstr ""
"我为了维持伪装才跟去的。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/7
msgid ""
"Chico thrust a fishing pole into my hands, and we\n"
"went up onto the deck,\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科把一根鱼竿塞进我手里，我们\n"
"走上了甲板，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/8
msgid ""
"where several soldiers had gathered.\n"
msgstr ""
"那里聚着几个士兵。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/9
msgid ""
"They welcomed us warmly.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们热情地欢迎我们。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/10
msgid ""
"With so few women aboard Mother Base, I'm\n"
"treated like a princess.\n"
msgstr ""
"母基地女人少，我\n"
"被当公主对待。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/11
msgid ""
"No one suspects I'm neither a teenager nor a\n"
"student.\n"
msgstr ""
"没人怀疑我既不是少女也不是\n"
"学生。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/12
msgid ""
"It was nice and sunny,\n"
msgstr ""
"天气晴朗，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/13
msgid ""
"with a gentle breeze and waves.\n"
msgstr ""
"微风轻拂，波浪轻摇。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/14
msgid ""
"As I cast my line and waited for a bite,\n"
msgstr ""
"我抛下鱼线等鱼上钩，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/15
msgid ""
"the soldiers began to ask me all sorts of questions.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们开始问我各种问题。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/16
msgid ""
"As always,\n"
msgstr ""
"一如既往，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/17
msgid ""
"I answered according to our pre-defined scenario,\n"
"feigning a smile.\n"
msgstr ""
"我按照我们预先设定的剧本回答，\n"
"假装微笑。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/18
msgid ""
"As I sat there feeding them lies, the fish began to\n"
"bite,\n"
msgstr ""
"我坐着灌他们谎话，鱼开始\n"
"上钩了，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/19
msgid ""
"and the soldiers began to focus on their prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们也开始专注自己的猎物。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/20
msgid ""
"Chico had his bait stolen by a fish,\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科的鱼饵被鱼叼走了，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/21
msgid ""
"and got so angry that he stood up and nearly fell\n"
"into the sea.\n"
msgstr ""
"他气得站了起来，差点\n"
"掉进海里。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/22
msgid ""
"Everybody laughed.\n"
msgstr ""
"大家都笑了。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/23
msgid ""
"It almost made me want to join in, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"我几乎也想跟着笑。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/24
msgid ""
"At some point, I got a bite myself.\n"
msgstr ""
"后来，我也钓到一条。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/25
msgid ""
"The instant after I felt that first gentle tug,\n"
msgstr ""
"感到那轻轻一拽的瞬间，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/26
msgid ""
"the fish yanked the line with astonishing strength,\n"
msgstr ""
"鱼以惊人的力气猛拉鱼线，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/27
msgid ""
"and I let out a cry of surprise.\n"
msgstr ""
"我惊叫出声。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/28
msgid ""
"I thought it was going to be huge.\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为会很大。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/29
msgid ""
"It was my first time fishing, and I was a bit\n"
"flustered,\n"
msgstr ""
"那是我第一次钓鱼，我有点\n"
"手忙脚乱，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/30
msgid ""
"so the soldier beside me helped by supporting the\n"
"pole from behind.\n"
msgstr ""
"于是我旁边的士兵从后面帮我撑住\n"
"鱼竿。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/31
msgid ""
"\"Reel it in!\" they shouted.\n"
msgstr ""
"\"收线！\"他们喊道。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/32
msgid ""
"I nodded, turning the handle as fast as I could.\n"
msgstr ""
"我点点头，拼命转动手柄。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/33
msgid ""
"I wondered what kind of fish live below the surface,\n"
msgstr ""
"我猜水面下有什么鱼，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/34
msgid ""
"and thought back to the deep-sea dives I had to\n"
"do as part of training.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后回想起训练时\n"
"不得不做的深海潜水。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/35
msgid ""
"Those were difficult days,\n"
msgstr ""
"那段日子很苦，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/36
msgid ""
"but I remember finding the multi-colored fish\n"
"gliding through the water incredibly soothing.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我记得发现那些五彩斑斓的鱼\n"
"在水中滑行，令人无比舒缓。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/37
msgid ""
"After a hard fight, I pulled it up. To my surprise,\n"
msgstr ""
"苦战后，我拉它上来。没想到，\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/38
msgid ""
"it wasn't even half a vara (16 in). Rather\n"
"anti-climactic.\n"
msgstr ""
"还不到半巴拉（16英寸）。真\n"
"扫兴。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/39
msgid ""
"But I wasn't doing it for fun, so I wasn't the least\n"
"bit disappointed.\n"
msgstr ""
"但我不是为了好玩才做的，所以我一点也不\n"
"失望。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/40
msgid ""
"Nuke was hovering nearby with an expectant look\n"
"on his face, so I gave the fish to him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nuke 带着期待的表情在附近徘徊，\n"
"于是我把鱼给了他。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10b0e0/41
msgid ""
"All in all, a thoroughly wasted day.\n"
msgstr ""
"总之，白费了一天。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/0
msgid ""
"Preparations are coming along nicely.\n"
msgstr ""
"准备工作进展顺利。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/1
msgid ""
"No one suspects me of being the one to let\n"
"Zadornov out of his cell.\n"
msgstr ""
"没人怀疑\n"
"是我放走了扎多尔诺夫。\n"

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/2
msgid ""
"Today, Amanda and I taught Cecile how to make\n"
"gallo pinto.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/3
msgid ""
"It is a simple, home-cooked dish consisting of black\n"
"frijoles mixed with arroz.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/4
msgid ""
"It is well-known throughout Central America, not\n"
"just in Costa Rica,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/5
msgid ""
"so it is no surprise that a Nica like Amanda would\n"
"be good at making it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/6
msgid ""
"But I was raised in the States from a very young\n"
"age\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/7
msgid ""
"and can hardly even remember my mother's gallo\n"
"pinto.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/8
msgid ""
"Having to make chit-chat with that clueless\n"
"bird-lover\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/9
msgid ""
"and the so-called revolutionary was excruciating.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/10
msgid ""
"And - clueless or not - I will need to be especially\n"
"careful around Cecile,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/11
msgid ""
"the one who actually recorded that tape.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/12
msgid ""
"Thankfully, Miller and his men seem to believe I\n"
"mistook the tape I found for one my friend made...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/13
msgid ""
"In any case, one can never be too careful.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/14
msgid ""
"...Anyway, the three of us minced garlic and herbs,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/15
msgid ""
"then cooked them in a pot with frijoles we'd\n"
"soaked overnight.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/16
msgid ""
"While waiting for them to cook, we sautéed onions\n"
"and arroz in a frying pan.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/17
msgid ""
"Cecile worked the frying pan according to\n"
"Amanda's directions, but seemed a bit glum.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/18
msgid ""
"She does have a knack for cooking, though - she\n"
"is French, after all.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/19
msgid ""
"We added water to the pan, and watched the arroz\n"
"begin to steam.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/20
msgid ""
"While we waited, Amanda shared memories of her\n"
"mother with us.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/21
msgid ""
"They had been separated because of Somoza,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/22
msgid ""
"but the taste of her mother's cooking was still\n"
"fresh in her mind.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/23
msgid ""
"When the frijoles were ready, we drained the\n"
"water,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/24
msgid ""
"stir-frying them with the rest of the vegetables.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/25
msgid ""
"Quite a complicated process for home-cooking.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/26
msgid ""
"Nonetheless, it kept them occupied.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/27
msgid ""
"The longer we sat and talked, the greater the\n"
"chance of my arousing their suspicions.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/28
msgid ""
"With women, it is not enough to just to bat your\n"
"eyelashes and giggle.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/29
msgid ""
"It takes a lot of effort to divert attention.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/30
msgid ""
"When the arroz was done cooking,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/31
msgid ""
"we folded it into the frijoles and added salsa,\n"
"stirring the mixture as it simmered.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/32
msgid ""
"At this point, for some reason the conversation\n"
"turned to romance.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/33
msgid ""
"Why does it have to be that way whenever women\n"
"get together and chat?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/34
msgid ""
"Cecile fancies herself to be well-versed in such\n"
"matters, and gave Amanda all sorts of advice.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/35
msgid ""
"It was harmless enough until, to my irritation,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/36
msgid ""
"she began pestering me whether there was\n"
"anybody I \"liked.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/37
msgid ""
"\"Not right now,\" I said, trying to dodge the\n"
"question.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/38
msgid ""
"But she pressed on. \"It's Snake, isn't it?\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/39
msgid ""
"I gritted my teeth and played it coy: \"Maybe.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/40
msgid ""
"Cecile nodded and giggled, \"He's pretty sexy, isn't\n"
"he?\" What a ditz.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/41
msgid ""
"It's all I can manage to just survive.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/42
msgid ""
"The thought of romance has never once crossed\n"
"my mind.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/43
msgid ""
"I've no interest in that kind of man.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/44
msgid ""
"Soon enough, a rich aroma began to fill the room -\n"
"the gallo pinto was ready.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/45
msgid ""
"Nuke came over and rubbed up against our legs,\n"
"looking for a handout.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/46
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, it was not the kind of food a cat\n"
"would like.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/47
msgid ""
"We let a few of the soldiers have a bite and then\n"
"headed off to the mess hall.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/48
msgid ""
"The home-cooked flavor we'd achieved was a big\n"
"hit with the men of MSF.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/49
msgid ""
"Not that we are trying to impress them or\n"
"anything. Even I could manage a dish like that.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/50
msgid ""
"Snake enjoyed it, too...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/267/0x10be70/51
msgid ""
"Let me make this absolutely clear: I have no\n"
"interest in that man.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/0
msgid ""
"Futbol, or \"soccer\" as it is known in the states,\n"
msgstr ""
"Futbol，美国人叫\"soccer\"，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/1
msgid ""
"is extremely popular here.\n"
msgstr ""
"在这里极受欢迎。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/2
msgid ""
"It has not caught on yet in the US,\n"
msgstr ""
"美国还没流行起来，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/3
msgid ""
"but it has legions of rabid fans all across Latin\n"
"America.\n"
msgstr ""
"但它在整个拉丁美洲\n"
"拥有大批狂热粉丝。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/4
msgid ""
"These fans can get so rowdy\n"
msgstr ""
"这些球迷闹起来，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/5
msgid ""
"that it is commonly believed El Salvador and\n"
"Honduras went to war in 1969 over scuffles in a\n"
"soccer match.\n"
msgstr ""
"人们普遍认为萨尔瓦多和\n"
"洪都拉斯在1969年因一场\n"
"足球比赛中的冲突而开战。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/6
msgid ""
"In reality, tensions between the two countries were\n"
"already high.\n"
msgstr ""
"实际上，两国之间的紧张局势\n"
"早已高涨。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/7
msgid ""
"The match was merely one of the sparks that set\n"
"them off.\n"
msgstr ""
"那场比赛仅仅是\n"
"点燃导火索的火花之一。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/8
msgid ""
"But these people are so passionate about the\n"
"sport\n"
msgstr ""
"但这些人对这项运动\n"
"如此狂热\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/9
msgid ""
"that the story seems plausible.\n"
msgstr ""
"这说法听着也像真的。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/10
msgid ""
"Predictably, many of the soldiers here are fans.\n"
msgstr ""
"不出所料，这里很多兵都是球迷。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/11
msgid ""
"They have apparently divided themselves\n"
msgstr ""
"他们显然分成了\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/12
msgid ""
"into Costa Rican and Nicaraguan teams and\n"
"started playing each other.\n"
msgstr ""
"分成哥斯达黎加队和尼加拉瓜队，\n"
"开始互相比赛。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/13
msgid ""
"To play, you need a ball and two goals.\n"
msgstr ""
"踢球需要球和两个球门。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/14
msgid ""
"The R&D team built and set up simple goals on the\n"
"deck.\n"
msgstr ""
"研发团队在甲板上\n"
"搭建了简易球门。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/15
msgid ""
"I had absolutely no interest,\n"
msgstr ""
"我完全没兴趣，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/16
msgid ""
"but Chico insisted that I come and watch.\n"
msgstr ""
"但奇科非要我来看。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/17
msgid ""
"It was not a proper match by any means -\n"
msgstr ""
"这根本算不上正规比赛——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/18
msgid ""
"the pitch was not even regulation size -\n"
msgstr ""
"场地连标准尺寸都不到——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/19
msgid ""
"but the players and spectators alike got pretty\n"
"excited.\n"
msgstr ""
"但球员和观众都\n"
"相当兴奋。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/20
msgid ""
"They banged empty cans and shouted cheers\n"
"through the handmade megaphones.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们敲着空罐子，用自制扩音器\n"
"呐喊助威。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/21
msgid ""
"It almost felt like Carnival.\n"
msgstr ""
"简直像狂欢节。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/22
msgid ""
"Huey, the referee, blew a whistle to start the\n"
"match.\n"
msgstr ""
"裁判 Huey 吹响哨子\n"
"开始比赛。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/23
msgid ""
"The soldiers' training has left them in excellent\n"
"physical shape.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们的训练让他们保持了\n"
"极佳的体能状态。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/24
msgid ""
"But they lacked the honed skills of professionals,\n"
msgstr ""
"但缺乏职业球员的精湛技术，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/25
msgid ""
"and their play was quite rough.\n"
msgstr ""
"踢得相当粗野。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/26
msgid ""
"Midway through, one of the men collided with\n"
"another.\n"
msgstr ""
"比赛到一半，一人\n"
"与另一人相撞。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/27
msgid ""
"They started shouting at one another, but Huey\n"
"stepped in.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们开始互相叫嚷，但 Huey\n"
"介入调解。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/28
msgid ""
"\"I thought we had forsaken our countries, become\n"
"one with the earth,\" he said,\n"
msgstr ""
"“我以为我们已舍弃祖国，与大地\n"
"融为一体，”他说，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/29
msgid ""
"quoting Snake.\n"
msgstr ""
"引用着SNAKE的话。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/30
msgid ""
"\"We're not competing for national pride here.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们不是为国家荣誉而战。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/31
msgid ""
"And we are not fighting for the good of any one\n"
"country.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"我们不是为任何一个国家的\n"
"利益而战。”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/32
msgid ""
"\"This is not a war. Soccer's a peaceful sport, am I\n"
"right?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"“这不是战争。足球是一项和平的运动，\n"
"我说得对吧？”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/33
msgid ""
"The soldiers nodded.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们点头。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/34
msgid ""
"They know the pain of war, and they share Snake's\n"
"vision.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们懂战争之痛，也认同SNAKE的\n"
"理念。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/35
msgid ""
"Perhaps that is why this all resonates with them.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许正因如此，才引起他们共鸣。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/36
msgid ""
"Team Costa Rica was down a man,\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加队少一人，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/37
msgid ""
"and somehow I was picked to fill in.\n"
msgstr ""
"不知怎的选中我替补。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/38
msgid ""
"Costa Rica had the advantage up until that point -\n"
msgstr ""
"此前哥斯达黎加一直占优——\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/39
msgid ""
"I suppose Huey wanted to keep it balanced.\n"
msgstr ""
"休伊大概想保持平衡。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/40
msgid ""
"The soldiers agreed with Huey's call.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们都赞同休伊的决定。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/41
msgid ""
"Maybe the Costa Rican players felt an even match\n"
"up would be more fun, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许哥斯达黎加球员也觉得势均力敌\n"
"的比赛更好玩。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/42
msgid ""
"I could not be bothered to run at first,\n"
msgstr ""
"一开始我懒得跑，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/43
msgid ""
"but chasing the ball out there in the hot sun, I was\n"
"soon drenched in sweat.\n"
msgstr ""
"但在烈日下追着球跑，我很快\n"
"就浑身是汗。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/44
msgid ""
"Before long I found myself actively seeking out the\n"
"ball,\n"
msgstr ""
"没过多久我就发现自己主动去\n"
"找球了，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/45
msgid ""
"partially out of desperation.\n"
msgstr ""
"一半是出于无奈。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/46
msgid ""
"I picked up a loose ball deep on the opponents'\n"
"side of the field.\n"
msgstr ""
"我在对方半场深处捡到一个\n"
"散球。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/47
msgid ""
"Even though he's Nicaraguan, Chico cheered me\n"
"on, yelling \"Go for it! Shoot!\"\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科是尼加拉瓜人，却为我\n"
"加油喊“冲啊！射门！”\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/48
msgid ""
"I launched that ball as hard as I could,\n"
msgstr ""
"我用尽全力踢出那球，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/49
msgid ""
"only to have it blocked by the keeper.\n"
msgstr ""
"却被守门员挡了下来。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/50
msgid ""
"Disappointment only increased my determination.\n"
msgstr ""
"失望反而让我更坚定。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/51
msgid ""
"In the end, I didn't score a single goal,\n"
msgstr ""
"最后我一个球都没进，\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/52
msgid ""
"and Costa Rica gave up its lead.\n"
msgstr ""
"哥斯达黎加丢了领先。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/53
msgid ""
"It was really close, though.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过比分很接近。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/54
msgid ""
"We congratulated each other on a good match\n"
msgstr ""
"我们互相祝贺这场好比赛\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/55
msgid ""
"and sprawled out in the shade on the deck,\n"
"exhausted.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后精疲力尽地瘫在甲板的\n"
"阴凉处。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/56
msgid ""
"The ocean breeze felt so nice on my sun-soaked\n"
"body.\n"
msgstr ""
"海风吹着我晒热的\n"
"身子，真舒服。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/57
msgid ""
"Nuke came over - it is one of his favorite spots -\n"
msgstr ""
"努克也来了，他最爱这儿\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/58
msgid ""
"and stretched out next to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"在我旁边伸展开来。\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/59
msgid ""
"And together\n"
msgstr ""
"我们一起\n"

#: codec/1/269/0x10d1e0/60
msgid ""
"we watched fluffy white clouds drift lazily across\n"
"the clear blue sky.\n"
msgstr ""
"看着蓬松的白云懒洋洋地飘过\n"
"清澈的蓝天。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/0
msgid ""
"It was lovely out today,\n"
msgstr ""
"今天天气很好，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/1
msgid ""
"so I decided to sun myself in a lounge chair up on\n"
"the deck\n"
msgstr ""
"所以我到甲板上\n"
"躺椅里晒太阳，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/2
msgid ""
"when Strangelove came up to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"就在这时奇爱博士走了过来。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/3
msgid ""
"Despite the heat, she was in her usual long sleeves\n"
"and pants.\n"
msgstr ""
"天气很热，她还是老样子，\n"
"长袖长裤。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/4
msgid ""
"I waved at her.\n"
msgstr ""
"我向她挥手。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/5
msgid ""
"She looked away and mumbled, \"H-hello there.\n"
"Fancy meeting you here.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"她移开视线，嘀咕道：\n"
"「你、你好。真巧啊。」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/6
msgid ""
"I asked if she needed anything,\n"
msgstr ""
"我问她有什么事，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/7
msgid ""
"feeling her eyes creeping up and down my body,\n"
"like she was savoring it.\n"
msgstr ""
"感觉她的目光在我身上上下游走，\n"
"像在细细品味。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/8
msgid ""
"Finally she swallowed and said,\n"
msgstr ""
"最后她咽了口唾沫，说：\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/9
msgid ""
"\"You have such beautiful skin...\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「你的皮肤真美……」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/10
msgid ""
"Bewildered, I shook my head and said, \"No, not at\n"
"all.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"我不知所措，摇摇头说：\n"
"「不，一点也谈不上。」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/11
msgid ""
"I'd heard rumors that she was a... lesbian.\n"
msgstr ""
"我听说过她是个……同性恋。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/12
msgid ""
"But she couldn't be after me, could she?\n"
msgstr ""
"可她不至于看上我吧？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/13
msgid ""
"She continued to stare and said,\n"
msgstr ""
"她继续盯着我，说：\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/14
msgid ""
"\"No, it is beautiful. But you must not let yourself\n"
"get so tanned.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「不，真的很美。\n"
"可你不能晒这么黑。」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/15
msgid ""
"And then she took my hand in hers.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后她握住了我的手。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/16
msgid ""
"\"What is wrong with a little sun?\" I asked, trying to\n"
"cut the conversation short.\n"
msgstr ""
"「晒一点太阳有什么关系？」\n"
"我想尽快结束话题。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/17
msgid ""
"But she shook her head violently.\n"
msgstr ""
"可她使劲摇头。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/18
msgid ""
"\"No! You mustn't! A young lady should take better\n"
"care of her skin!\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「不行！绝对不行！\n"
"年轻姑娘要好好爱护皮肤！」\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/19
msgid ""
"She was acting strangely, now, as if aroused.\n"
msgstr ""
"她举止变得奇怪，像是动了情。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/20
msgid ""
"She lectured me on the perils of tanning - how it\n"
"ages skin,\n"
msgstr ""
"她开始说教日晒的危害——\n"
"会让皮肤老化，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/21
msgid ""
"causing wrinkles and spots, and in the worst cases\n"
"even skin cancer.\n"
msgstr ""
"长出皱纹和色斑，\n"
"严重的还会得皮肤癌。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/22
msgid ""
"I knew already that tanning could cause spots, but\n"
msgstr ""
"我知道日晒会长斑，不过\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/23
msgid ""
"I thought only pale-skinned Anglo-Saxons had to\n"
"deal with that.\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为只有白皮肤的\n"
"盎格鲁-撒克逊人才会。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/24
msgid ""
"Having a scientist tell me it causes aging, though -\n"
msgstr ""
"不过由科学家亲口说会衰老——\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/25
msgid ""
"that spooked me a little.\n"
msgstr ""
"这让我有点发毛。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/26
msgid ""
"If I am to keep playing the teenager,\n"
msgstr ""
"要继续扮演女学生，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/27
msgid ""
"I will have to start paying more attention to my skin.\n"
msgstr ""
"我就得更注意皮肤保养了。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/28
msgid ""
"Sensing my anxiety, she took a small tube from her\n"
"pocket.\n"
msgstr ""
"她察觉到我的不安，\n"
"从口袋里掏出一支小管。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/29
msgid ""
"She said it was the sunscreen she always used.\n"
msgstr ""
"说那是她常用的防晒霜。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/30
msgid ""
"She told me to keep it. I didn't know what to say.\n"
msgstr ""
"她说送我了。我不知该说什么。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/31
msgid ""
"I was more than happy to take it, but exactly what\n"
"were her intentions?\n"
msgstr ""
"我当然乐意收下，\n"
"可她到底什么意图？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/32
msgid ""
"Was she merely being nice?\n"
msgstr ""
"只是出于好意吗？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/33
msgid ""
"Or is she really into me?\n"
msgstr ""
"还是真的对我有意思？\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/34
msgid ""
"Either way, there was no reason to refuse, I\n"
"suppose.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管怎样，\n"
"我想没有理由拒绝。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/35
msgid ""
"I have undergone training.\n"
msgstr ""
"我受过训练。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/36
msgid ""
"An out-of-shape woman doesn't pose any real\n"
"threat to me.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个缺乏锻炼的女人\n"
"对我构不成威胁。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/37
msgid ""
"Having power means not being afraid.\n"
msgstr ""
"拥有力量就无需畏惧。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/38
msgid ""
"It is the same on a global scale:\n"
msgstr ""
"国家层面也是一样：\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/39
msgid ""
"a country with nukes can dictate terms to a\n"
"country without them.\n"
msgstr ""
"有核国家可以对无核国家\n"
"发号施令。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/40
msgid ""
"I thanked her and took the tube.\n"
msgstr ""
"我道了谢，收下那支药膏。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/41
msgid ""
"Then she offered to put some on for me.\n"
msgstr ""
"接着她提出要帮我涂。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/42
msgid ""
"She squirted some lotion onto her fingers and\n"
"began rubbing it into my chest.\n"
msgstr ""
"她把乳液挤在手指上，\n"
"开始往我胸口涂。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/43
msgid ""
"It happened so suddenly,\n"
msgstr ""
"一切来得太突然，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/44
msgid ""
"and I was so taken aback that I did not even think\n"
"to protest.\n"
msgstr ""
"我太过错愕，\n"
"根本没想到要反抗。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/45
msgid ""
"She caressed my stomach with her long, white\n"
"fingers,\n"
msgstr ""
"她用修长白皙的手指\n"
"抚过我的腹部，\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/46
msgid ""
"then slid them upwards between my bikini-clad\n"
"breasts.\n"
msgstr ""
"又向上滑进\n"
"我比基尼包裹的双乳之间。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/47
msgid ""
"\"Wha-? Wait...\" I sputtered as her moist eyes met\n"
"mine.\n"
msgstr ""
"「什、等等……」我结巴着，\n"
"对上她湿润的眼睛。\n"

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/48
msgid ""
"She was beautiful...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/49
msgid ""
"Somehow, I found myself captivated by this woman\n"
"more than ten years my elder.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/50
msgid ""
"\"Hold still,\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/51
msgid ""
"she whispered in my ear. I nodded silently, unable\n"
"to refuse.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/52
msgid ""
"My body went limp, motionless, as if in a trance.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/53
msgid ""
"Gently, carefully, she rubbed the lotion all over my\n"
"entire body.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/54
msgid ""
"I shouldn't have enjoyed it.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/55
msgid ""
"And yet I could not help myself. For a moment, I\n"
"was spellbound.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/56
msgid ""
"That woman is dangerous...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/270/0x10e5a0/57
msgid ""
"I had better watch myself.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/0
msgid ""
"Protecting one's health is an important part of any\n"
"agent's job,\n"
msgstr ""
"保持健康是\n"
"特工工作的重要一环，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/1
msgid ""
"but despite my best efforts, I have caught a cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"可再怎么小心，我还是感冒了。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/2
msgid ""
"Now that I think about it,\n"
msgstr ""
"现在想来，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/3
msgid ""
"Mother Base's numbers are on the rise,\n"
msgstr ""
"母基地的人越来越多，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/4
msgid ""
"with soldiers coming from all different places and\n"
"backgrounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"士兵们来自\n"
"各地不同的背景。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/5
msgid ""
"It is no wonder, then, that sooner or later someone\n"
"would bring in a virus.\n"
msgstr ""
"迟早有人把病毒带进来，\n"
"也不足为奇。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/6
msgid ""
"That said, what I have got is just a common cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过我得的只是普通感冒。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/7
msgid ""
"The medical team said I'd need a few days' rest,\n"
msgstr ""
"医疗组说要休息几天，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/8
msgid ""
"so I've been restricted to my room and put on bed\n"
"rest.\n"
msgstr ""
"于是我被关在房间里\n"
"卧床静养。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/9
msgid ""
"I thought I'd gotten used to not having anyone\n"
"around to relate to...\n"
msgstr ""
"我以为自己已经习惯了\n"
"身边无人可以倾诉……\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/10
msgid ""
"But at times like these, being alone is just...\n"
"miserable.\n"
msgstr ""
"可这种时候，孤独\n"
"实在……难熬。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/11
msgid ""
"All I could do is lay there and stroke Nuke's back,\n"
msgstr ""
"我只能躺着抚摸Nuke的背，\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/12
msgid ""
"trying to take my mind off how bad I felt.\n"
msgstr ""
"好让自己不去想有多难受。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/13
msgid ""
"Nuke just sat there, not making a sound.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nuke只是静静地坐着，一声不响。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/14
msgid ""
"But I did have visitors:\n"
msgstr ""
"不过也有人来看我：\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/15
msgid ""
"Amanda and Chico, Huey, Cecile, Miller, and a few\n"
"of the soldiers I've become relatively close to.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达和奇科、休伊、塞西尔、米勒，\n"
"还有几个比较熟的士兵。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/16
msgid ""
"Amanda made me a soup with herbs she said were\n"
"good for a cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"阿曼达用对感冒有益的草药\n"
"给我煮了汤。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/17
msgid ""
"Miller told me to take it easy. \"I will sing you a\n"
"lullaby,\"\n"
msgstr ""
"米勒让我放轻松。\n"
"「我给你唱首摇篮曲，」\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/18
msgid ""
"he said, then broke out a guitar and sang some\n"
"incomprehensible song in Japanese.\n"
msgstr ""
"他说着掏出吉他，\n"
"唱了首听不懂的日语歌。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/19
msgid ""
"I did not need to understand the lyrics to know\n"
"he's an awful singer.\n"
msgstr ""
"不用听懂歌词，\n"
"我也知道他唱得极差。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/20
msgid ""
"Then he said, \"You know what is good for a cold?\n"
"Suppositories! Here, I'll show you...\"\n"
msgstr ""
"然后他说：「你知道感冒最有效的是什么吗？\n"
"栓剂！来，我示范给你看……」\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/21
msgid ""
"He began to take off his pants, so I threw my\n"
"tissue box at him to make him go away.\n"
msgstr ""
"他开始脱裤子，\n"
"我抓起纸巾盒砸他，把他赶走。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/22
msgid ""
"Then Strangelove showed up, saying she had some\n"
"miracle Indian cure.\n"
msgstr ""
"接着奇爱博士来了，\n"
"说有印度的神奇疗法。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/23
msgid ""
"\"It has got eucalyptus extract,\" she said. \"It works\n"
"best if you rub it into your chest.\"\n"
msgstr ""
"「里面含有桉树精华，」她说。\n"
"「涂在胸口效果最好。」\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/24
msgid ""
"And then she tried to take off my nightshirt.\n"
msgstr ""
"然后她就要脱我的睡衣。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/25
msgid ""
"I whacked her with my pillow. And that got rid of\n"
"her.\n"
msgstr ""
"我拿枕头砸她，\n"
"总算把她赶走了。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/26
msgid ""
"Chico brought me a little flower in a cup.\n"
msgstr ""
"奇科用杯子给我带了朵小花。\n"

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/27
msgid ""
"It had been growing in a little bit of earth that\n"
"probably found its way on board stuck to\n"
"something else.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/28
msgid ""
"\"I found this on the deck. Here, you can have it.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/29
msgid ""
"He tried to act nonchalant, but I'm pretty sure he's\n"
"got a crush on me.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/30
msgid ""
"None of them understand.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/31
msgid ""
"If they thought these little visits would cheer me\n"
"up, they were wrong.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/32
msgid ""
"Tonight, Snake himself came to my room.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/33
msgid ""
"Like the rest, he believes I am just a schoolgirl,\n"
"and treats me as such.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/34
msgid ""
"\"Why did you abandon your country,\" I asked him.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/35
msgid ""
"\"Why create the MSF?\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/36
msgid ""
"Of course, I knew the answers already. But I\n"
"wanted to hear it from him.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/37
msgid ""
"As I had imagined, he was not exactly forthcoming.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/38
msgid ""
"All he would say is that his country abandoned him\n"
"because all he could do was fight.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/39
msgid ""
"And that is why he needed the MSF - because that\n"
"is all he is any good for.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/40
msgid ""
"Then he said,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/41
msgid ""
"\"Fighting is the only thing I understand.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/42
msgid ""
"But that does not mean I have got a grudge\n"
"against those who believe in peace.\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/43
msgid ""
"I am not one of them, and I do not believe in peace.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/44
msgid ""
"Conflict is in man's nature. We fight our enemies in\n"
"order to survive.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/45
msgid ""
"Maybe we're not so different after all, he and I.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/46
msgid ""
"But that is exactly why I am going to have to kill\n"
"him.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/47
msgid ""
"Or else he will have to kill me.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/48
msgid ""
"When I stop and think about this wretched\n"
"existence,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/49
msgid ""
"being killed by a man like that\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/271/0x10f840/50
msgid ""
"suddenly does not seem like such a bad thing.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/0
msgid ""
"Every month,\n"
msgstr ""
"每个月，\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/1
msgid ""
"Mother Base throws a party for all the soldiers\n"
"whose birthdays fall in that month.\n"
msgstr ""
"母基地都会为当月过生日的士兵\n"
"办一场聚会。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/2
msgid ""
"There's something strange about a military\n"
"organization having parties.\n"
msgstr ""
"军队这种组织办聚会，\n"
"总觉得有些奇怪。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/3
msgid ""
"Really, though, it is just an excuse to drink and\n"
"make noise.\n"
msgstr ""
"不过说到底，\n"
"只是个喝酒喧闹的借口。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/4
msgid ""
"It is not easy to get alcohol on a fortress in the\n"
"middle of the ocean.\n"
msgstr ""
"在大海中央的堡垒里，\n"
"酒可不容易弄到。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/5
msgid ""
"Most days they are training from dawn till dusk.\n"
msgstr ""
"平日他们从早训练到晚。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/6
msgid ""
"They do not have time for things like drinking.\n"
msgstr ""
"根本没时间喝酒。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/7
msgid ""
"That is why Snake and Miller came up with the\n"
"idea - to give everyone a chance to let loose.\n"
msgstr ""
"所以Snake和米勒才出了这主意——\n"
"让大家有机会放松一下。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/8
msgid ""
"Obviously, a bunch of boors like that are not going\n"
"to bother with blowing out candles on a cake.\n"
msgstr ""
"显然，这帮粗人不会去\n"
"吹蛋糕上的蜡烛。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/9
msgid ""
"Rather, they sit there in a cloud of cigarette\n"
"smoke,\n"
msgstr ""
"他们只是坐在\n"
"烟雾缭绕里，\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/10
msgid ""
"drink beer, eat meat, tell tasteless jokes and swap\n"
"crude insults about one another's hometowns.\n"
msgstr ""
"喝啤酒、吃肉、讲荤段子，\n"
"互相拿家乡开粗俗的玩笑。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/11
msgid ""
"But it hardly ever breaks out into something\n"
"serious.\n"
msgstr ""
"但很少\n"
"真的闹起来。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/12
msgid ""
"They talk up a storm, but they're just having fun.\n"
msgstr ""
"他们吵得热闹，其实只是开心。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/13
msgid ""
"It is funny. You've got members of FSLN rubbing\n"
"shoulders with the UCLAs.\n"
msgstr ""
"真有意思。桑解阵的人\n"
"竟和UCLA的人并肩而坐。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/14
msgid ""
"People who once would have considered the other\n"
"mortal enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"换作从前，\n"
"他们可是死敌。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/15
msgid ""
"I wonder if that is what makes Big Boss so popular.\n"
msgstr ""
"也许正因如此Big Boss才如此受拥戴。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/16
msgid ""
"In leaving their countries behind, they leave their\n"
"hatred for other countries, too.\n"
msgstr ""
"离开祖国的同时，\n"
"他们也放下了对他国的仇恨。\n"

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/17
msgid ""
"Miller seemed a little protective of me.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/18
msgid ""
"\"Hope they're not being too crude,\" he said. But\n"
"soon enough he too was drunk.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/19
msgid ""
"He yelled, \"C'mere and take a look at the REAL\n"
"Kazuhira Miller!\"\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/20
msgid ""
"then dropped his pants and mooned everybody.\n"
"The other soldiers burst out laughing.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/21
msgid ""
"I have never seen such a crude, ridiculous party\n"
"before. And yet...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/22
msgid ""
"All these people, laughing and acting the fool\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/23
msgid ""
"- is this what they call peace?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/272/0x110ab0/24
msgid ""
"For some reason, I began to think about all that\n"
"has happened since I came here.\n"
msgstr ""
